[{"client_msg_id":"927d57f7-f7b2-45b4-8d10-57a0b7416f55","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ググってみたら南部鉄器のものはなかったけど確かテレビでみた気がするんだよな","ts":"1618574836.333700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HZfZF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c3e772a-99d1-4d8a-9977-9d5c374085a1","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://wired.jp/2015/07/04/lucky-iron-fish/|https://wired.jp/2015/07/04/lucky-iron-fish/\u003e","ts":"1618574807.333500","attachments":[{"fallback":"WIRED.jp: カンボジアの人を貧血から守る鉄製の魚「Lucky Iron Fish」","id":1,"title":"カンボジアの人を貧血から守る鉄製の魚「Lucky Iron Fish」","title_link":"https://wired.jp/2015/07/04/lucky-iron-fish/","text":"カンボジアには、貧血を治してくれる魔法の魚がいる。と言ってもそれは生きた魚ではなく、鉄の塊だ。「調理時に鍋に入れるだけ」という手軽さに加え、現地の人に受け入れられやすいよう幸運のシンボルをモチーフにしたことが功を奏し、魚は順調に人々の間に広まっている。","image_url":"https://wired.jp/app/uploads/2015/07/Washing_fish_IMG_53721-582x437-e1435815756530.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"WIRED.jp","service_icon":"https://wired.jp/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://wired.jp/2015/07/04/lucky-iron-fish/","original_url":"https://wired.jp/2015/07/04/lucky-iron-fish/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HnDB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f07c1c1b-a062-4f1c-812d-91089d38922f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"発展途上国向けに鍋に放り込むだけで鉄分不足が解消できる南部鉄器とかあったはず","ts":"1618574692.333400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vrd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd318bd1-b3d2-40cf-9579-38a4c1766433","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、なるほど","ts":"1618541738.332100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3mRJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7587253c-09a3-4af9-aba6-e35f08fb84e3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ひじきは料理・調理っていうか出荷時に煮てるんですよね。そういう意味ではしらすも大半は煮られてるか。","ts":"1618541682.331800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1618541699.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W3Si"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ebcd6b8-eb8f-448c-b267-715b41ea38f1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"他の料理も鉄鍋のはずだけど、ひじきだけなの黒くて含んでても気にせずくってたからなんだろうか...","ts":"1618541283.330600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VA5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0a9849b-a0fc-4166-b886-99aed346f252","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ひじきの豊富とされていた鉄分はほとんど煮る時に使ってた鉄鍋から出たもので、ステンレス鍋に移行してからは減って豊富とは言えなくなったって話がありましたねw","ts":"1618540815.329900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lqB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C453188E-E034-487D-9567-877E4E02F2EA","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"茄子漬けなら発色のために使えそうですが、鉄玉子的な効果もあるんですかね？\nすぐに錆びそう","ts":"1618539745.328800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GSY="}]},{"client_msg_id":"dab3b5e4-28a3-4480-93e4-72a037e24484","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうそう。僕もこういうのイメージしてググったら南部鉄器がでてきて???ってなった。","ts":"1618539236.327100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lk9h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69F72A78-3E61-4340-A135-3E3239C8154B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"うちで使ってるのはおそらく陶器ですね。ケースに付いてきました。","ts":"1618539102.326300","files":[{"id":"F01UHAFEN58","created":1618539062,"timestamp":1618539062,"name":"Image from iOS.jpg","title":"Image from iOS","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":381283,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01UH