T0","text":"南国島国の現地料理は基本的にぜんぶ大味なイメージ。","ts":"1618504549.312100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f41lU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d185390d-49c1-4e08-bb9a-6d02b24eca7c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"vancouverでけっこう長くやっている店らしく、いろいろとあれしていそう","ts":"1618504422.310400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JWz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54f63c75-4f80-4485-9fcc-1b75c6af7c08","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"そのへんはたしかに混在してるかもしれない \u0026gt; 華やかさ :flag-id: :flag-ca:","ts":"1618504372.309700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zLfn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AA74D7FB-E0D0-4BED-9996-CEF5651ECAE8","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"インドネシア料理って華やかですね。\nというよりカナダナイズされたセンスなのかな。\n他のカナダのテイクアウトケースの盛り付けされた写真も華やかな覚えがあったので。","ts":"1618504334.309000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xznQR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7354f423-b5ed-4418-b255-491a6f7f2e33","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ぬか、菌の種類は違うけど、あえていうとwashed cheeseに近い性質があるかもしれない","ts":"1618504331.308800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cheese_wedge","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hWvC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e22cbf4-f2da-4640-bec1-7df45f3f15e5","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"めちゃくちゃよさそう・・・!","ts":"1618504232.306000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6V9A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2FB3D04C-6EAA-4AD3-ACEE-FA5BA648AD79","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"こちらで紹介されている、モッツァレラチーズとササミは試してみたいです。\n手入れがどれくらい面倒くさくなるかですが、半年くらいぬか漬け生活を楽しめれば十分かなとw\n\u003chttps://mi-journey.jp/foodie/18468/|https://mi-journey.jp/foodie/18468/\u003e","ts":"1618504060.304800","attachments":[{"fallback":"三越伊勢丹の食メディア | FOODIE（フーディー）: ぬか漬けの美味しい作り方。ぬか床作りの基本。おすすめ食材・手入れ・失敗ポイントを編集部が検証！ | 三越伊勢丹の食メディア | FOODIE（フーディー）","id":1,"title":"ぬか漬けの美味しい作り方。ぬか床作りの基本。おすすめ食材・手入れ・失敗ポイントを編集部が検証！ | 三越伊勢丹の食メディア | FOODIE（フーディー）","title_link":"https://mi-journey.jp/foodie/18468/","text":"「手入れが大変」「匂いが苦手」とネガティブなイメージを持たれることが多いぬか漬け。でも実は、出汁の味や辛味などを自在にカスタマイズしたり、変わった食材を漬けてみたりとさまざまな味を楽しむことができる面白い料理なんです。編集部が挑戦しました。","image_url":"https://mi-journey.jp/foodie/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/0108_nukaduke_top2.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1452657658,"service_name":"三越伊勢丹の食メディア | FOODIE（フーディー）","service_icon":"https://mi-journey.jp/foodie/wp-content/themes/foodie/common/images/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://mi-journey.jp/foodie/18468/","original_url":"https://mi-journey.jp/foodie/18468/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PTAXm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23aa3e90-972b-419e-87d7-4425f9a24f3a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(注文したのはMee AyamとAyam Penyet)","ts":"1618504004.303500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bF8Ys"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e44cbb1-2243-4f96-bc88-cb53fefacb29","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"tempeh何気にこういう形できちんと食べれたのは初めてです。発行の技法でよくお目にかかった食材","ts":"1618503954.302000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nZkf"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1618503948.300200","files":[{"id":"F01U0LWHH0F","created":1618503901,"timestamp":1618503901,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U03C4RC8X","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":6643109,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03